  Slug: segmented-frame
  DisplayName: Segmented Frame
  IconPath: systems/pf2e/icons/features/classes/segmented-frame.webp
  Description: Hinges, clamps, and telescoping parts make your innovation collapsible
    and adjustable. It gains the modular trait for bludgeoning, piercing, and slashing.
    You can Interact to collapse the item down to light Bulk or to return it to your
    normal form. When it's collapsed to light Bulk, it has the concealable trait,
    which grants you a +2 circumstance bonus to Stealth checks and DCs to hide or
    conceal the weapon.
